# Prose docs keep their authored wrapping; Prettier formats code only.
*.md
# Agent review worktrees. CLAUDE.md's review fan-out creates these under
# `.claude/worktrees/`, each a full checkout carrying its own built `dist` and
# served `public/app` output. They are excluded from git by `.git/info/exclude`,
# which is per-clone and uncommitted — Prettier never sees it, so a review run
# left 29 build artefacts failing `pnpm format` for everyone. Stated here so
# the gate does not depend on a local file that is not in the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
